              "name": "source",
              "type": "PromiseLike<T> | SequenceHandle<T> | SequenceOperation<T>",
              "optional": false
            }
          ],
          "returnType": "SequenceGenerator<T>",
          "description": "Wait until source ends and return its value; its failure is thrown here, and its cancellation as a SequenceCancelledError. - A SequenceHandle: the step continues at the point on the clock where the handle's step ended, if this sequencer ran it. - A SequenceOperation: polled once per tick; cancelled if the step stops waiting first. - A promise: its value is delivered on the next tick after it settles. A promise cannot be cancelled, so a step that stops waiting only stops listening."
        },
